1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,676
On her phone, the pieces land in any order.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,371
The numbers put them back in line.

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,932
Her phone unlocks them, and the photo appears.

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,416
About 65 milliseconds. Faster than a blink.
